+      "Where it is now, and where it needs to go",
+      "Whether it runs and drives",
+      "Roughly when it is ready to collect",
+    ],
+    typical: ["Private cars", "4x4s and pickups", "Vans and minibuses", "Motorcycles", "Non-runners"],
+    photo:
+      "A car being driven up the ramp into the hold of a RO-RO vessel, or a car secured inside a shipping container.",
