+      "Container freight is the workhorse of everything we move that is not a running vehicle. Take a full container to yourself when the volume justifies it and you want the doors sealed from origin to destination, or share one when you do not. We quote both so you can see which is actually cheaper for your consignment rather than guessing.",
+    includes: [
+      "20ft, 40ft and 40ft high cube containers",
